{:adr-id "2607169900"
 :title "cloud-itonami-isic-2680 — Manufacture of Magnetic and Optical Media Plant-Operations Coordination Actor"
 :status :accepted
 :date "2026-07-15"
 :context
 "ISIC 2680 (Manufacture of magnetic and optical media) had a
  :spec-only placeholder pointing at a never-created
  gftdcojp/cloud-itonami-C2680 repo (gh api 404 confirmed at both the
  stale placeholder and the real cloud-itonami org before any work
  began; registry :name independently re-verified against a fresh
  clone). Closest verified sibling is cloud-itonami-isic-2640
  (Manufacture of consumer electronics) -- same back-office
  plant-operations coordination shape for a fixed processing plant
  with electronics/precision-manufacturing equipment and a real
  physical safety dimension."
 :decision
 "Implement cloud-itonami-isic-2680 mirroring cloud-itonami-isic-2640
  module-for-module: MagOpticalMediaAdvisor ⊣ Magnetic and Optical
  Media Plant Operations Governor + append-only audit ledger,
  langgraph-clj StateGraph. Four ops (log-production-batch/
  schedule-maintenance/flag-safety-concern/coordinate-shipment), all
  :effect :propose only. Twelve HARD governor checks: propose-only
  effect, closed op allowlist, closed proposal-effect allowlist,
  permanent equipment-actuate block (:actuate-equipment?), permanent
  content-replication licensing-authority block
  (:issue-certification?, IFPI SID-style self-issuance), independent
  equipment/batch verified+registered gates, independent
  shipment-quantity recompute, double-schedule guard, product-type
  validation (closed set cd/dvd/blu-ray/magnetic-tape/
  magnetic-strip-card), substrate-thickness-mm plausibility validation
  (0-1.5mm, grounded in ECMA-130/267/405 optical-disc thickness and
  ISO/IEC 7810 magnetic-strip-card thickness), defect-rate
  plausibility validation. flag-safety-concern (solvent-coating
  chemical hazard, equipment-safety hazard) always escalates
  regardless of confidence -- the domain-specific safety-concern
  vocabulary and the substrate-thickness-mm physical-geometry
  plausibility field (replacing 2640's dielectric-test-kv electrical
  safety-test-voltage field) are the deliberate departures from 2640's
  battery-safety/electrical-safety/RoHS-compliance vocabulary. Fully
  portable .cljc, no JVM-only interop anywhere in src/; actor graph
  invoked exclusively via langgraph.graph/run*."
 :consequences
 ["Certified magnetic-tape-coating and optical-disc-molding/stamping plant operators fork and deploy independently with auditable coordination records; direct coating/molding/stamping-line-equipment control, equipment actuation, and content-replication licensing self-issuance remain permanent, un-overridable HARD blocks"
  "Safety-concern flagging is a circuit-breaker, not a threshold -- always escalates to a human plant supervisor regardless of confidence"
  "kotoba-lang/industry registry entry \"2680\" promoted :spec -> :implemented, :repo/:business-id corrected from the stale gftdcojp/cloud-itonami-C2680 placeholder to cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-isic-2680"
  "Still a simulation/proposal layer, not a real plant-operations control system -- no integration with real plant-management databases (equipment telemetry, batch tracking, freight dispatch, licensing-body APIs)"]
